# Counter-example: an interpretation act typed also as a gmeow:Observation
# (fires lang:ActObservationConflation / shacl.NotConstraintComponent — the
# SECONDARY twin of the OWL disjointness).

@prefix lang:  <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/lang/> .
@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix ex:    <http://example.org/lang/> .

ex:english a lang:SignSystem .
ex:form a lang:WordForm ; lang:inSignSystem ex:english .

ex:act a lang:InterpretationAct , gmeow:Observation ;
    lang:interpretedForm ex:form .
